### List offers
GET http://localhost:5000/api/offers?page=1&limit=10

### Search offers
GET http://localhost:5000/api/offers?q=Monsoon

### Get one
GET http://localhost:5000/api/offers/offers-1

### Create (admin token)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/offers
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "The Last Ticket Offer",
  "bank": "ICICI",
  "discountPct": 15,
  "validTill": "2026-12-08"
}
